+  Authorization: 0
+  Cookie: 0
+  Proxy-Authorization: 0
+  X-Custom: 2
+string(2) "OK"
+--- origin C (2 requests) ---
+  Authorization: 2
+  Cookie: 2
+  Proxy-Authorization: 2
+  X-Custom: 2
+string(2) "OK"
+--- credential header last in the bag (307) ---
+POST /second HTTP/1.1
+Host: ...
+Connection: close
+Content-Length: 11
+X-Custom: keep-me
+Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
+
+hello=world--- malformed header bags ---
