+  folded value (tab)  SECRET leaked: 0, X-Custom kept: 1
+  lone CR             SECRET leaked: 0, X-Custom kept: 1
+  space before colon  SECRET leaked: 0, X-Custom kept: 1
+  tab before colon    SECRET leaked: 0, X-Custom kept: 1
